OL,3,APrince William joins other royalty at
OL,4,Afuneral of Norway's King Harald V as
OL,5,Acrowds line streets
OL,6,
OL,7,FFollowing a service at Oslo Cathedral,
OL,8,Fthere's a flypast with four F-35
OL,9,Ffighter jets seen in a so-called
OL,10,Fmissing man formation
OL,12,FThe king's casket is now making its way
OL,13,Ffrom the cathedral to Akershus
OL,14,FFortress, where the monarch will be
OL,15,Flaid to rest
OL,17,FPrince William is representing King
OL,18,FCharles while Princess Anne - godmother
OL,19,Fto the new Norwegian king - is in
OL,20,Fattendance but in a private capacity
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
